// The ore silo (WP7.3b, docs/rules/economy.md "The ore silo"): the storage scenario's playfield and
// harvest rules, with a silo built beside the refinery. The refinery stores 600 and the silo 400.
//
// `unit_defs` names `silo_defs`, a copy of `harvest_defs` (WP7.2) with the `ore_silo` added (kind 43,
// requires the refinery, 250 credits, 12 seconds = 240 ticks); the capacities are written out below
// (`storage`) so editing the shipped unit_defs.ron never moves this checksum. Kinds: 0 construction
// centre, 2 refinery, 11 harvester, 43 ore silo.
//
//   slot 0  the construction centre of player 0 on (84, 74)
//   slot 1  the refinery of player 0 on (96, 86): capacity 600
//   slot 2, 3  harvesters of player 0 on (104, 90) and (106, 92)
//   slot 4  the silo, BuildStructure at tick 2600 on (90, 78): under construction for 240 ticks (the
//           capacity stays 600), then standing: capacity 1000; sold at tick 4400: capacity 600 again,
//           below what is stored
//
// `repair` is only there because `Sell` needs it (no repair command is given; the sale takes 60 ticks).
//
// What happens: the store fills to 600 and a harvester waits in the bay holding its load; the silo
// stands and the store fills to 1000; the sale lowers the capacity, the 1000 stored are kept and
// nothing more is taken. tools/sf_headless/tests/silo.rs asserts those stages and the pinned
// checksum; CI runs the scenario on Linux and Windows and requires the checksum in silo.expected.
Scenario(
    name: "silo",
    seed: 0x0007_003b,
    map: (width: 256, height: 256),
    map_name: Some("playfield256"),
    unit_defs: Some("silo_defs"),
    buildings: true,
    factions: [(0, Meridian), (1, Veyran)],
    ore: Some((start: 120, max: 160, regrow_amount: 1, regrow_period: 200)),
    harvest: Some((
        harvesters: [11],
        capacity: 200,
        mine_amount: 4,
        mine_period: 8,
        unload_amount: 10,
        unload_period: 4,
        search_radius: 40,
        retry_period: 100,
        call_range: 6,
        grant_timeout: 400,
        call_timeout: 10,
        max_tries: 3,
        park_distance: 4,
        park_spread: 5,
        park_near_tenths: 20,
        mine_start_tenths: 10,
        mine_reach_tenths: 15,
        mine_lose_tenths: 25,
        dock_reach_tenths: 20,
        travel_cost: 16,
        queue_cost: 100,
        switch_margin: 100,
        recheck_period: 20,
        queue_gap: 3,
        queue_start: 1,
        queue_step: 2,
        queue_rows: 8,
    )),
    storage: Some([(2, 600), (43, 400)]),
    repair: Some((hp_per_tick: 5, full_cost_permille: 400, sell_ticks: 60, refund_permille: 700)),
    ticks: 6000,
    commands: [
        (tick: 0, command: PlaceStructure(kind: 0, owner: 0, cell: (84, 74))),
        (tick: 0, command: PlaceStructure(kind: 2, owner: 0, cell: (96, 86))),
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 11, owner: 0, cell: (104, 90))),
        (tick: 0, command: SpawnUnit(kind: 11, owner: 0, cell: (106, 92))),
        (tick: 2600, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 43, cell: (90, 78))),
        (tick: 4400, player: 0, command: Sell(structure: (4, 0))),
    ],
)
